    "description": "Manitowoc commercial ice machine full-spectrum troubleshooting across all five SoCal counties. Diagnostic conditions covered: production failure (no ice), low production (below nameplate), ice quality issues (cloudy / thin shells / wrong size), water leaks (drain-side / supply-side / internal), unusual noises (compressor / condenser fan / auger drive), cleaning and maintenance issues (AlphaSan + LuminIce II + scale buildup). Indigo NXT touchscreen Easy-Read display Fault History menu navigation with six named alerts (Long Freeze, No Harvest, Curtain Switch, Bin Full, High Discharge Temp, Low Water). Q-Series legacy numeric codes serviced. R-Series nugget (RNS-0385A, RNS-0820A) auger drive diagnostic. AlphaSan antimicrobial protection plus LuminIce II UV growth inhibitor (10,000-15,000 hour bulb life) maintenance. Acu-Thaw harvest cycle troubleshooting. Manitowoc Cleen Ice brand-spec cleaner. EPA 608 Universal plus R-290 hydrocarbon certified. Welbilt parts network. $120 commercial diagnostic, applied toward repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal #1346255700410.",
    "provider": { "@id": canonical + "#business" },
    "areaServed": [
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Los Angeles County" },
